    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "The desk. Everything that didn't fit anywhere else."
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "The lamp is on. Somebody left it on, or somebody is coming back."
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "Between the stapler and the zine there is a cardboard tube the length of a forearm, papered in a print of ducks, rubbed white at both ends by hands. Frosted glass at the far end. A clear eye at the near one."
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "Shake it and something inside answers. Not glass. A dry sound, like a feather in a drawer, like a claw on a cookie sheet, like a drive reading."
    },
    {
      "t": "cg",
      "src": "assets/cg/vol4_meld_kaleidoscope_tube.jpg",
      "caption": "the tube, the lamp, the desk"
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "Put it to your eye. Point it at the lamp."
    },
    {
      "t": "bg",
      "src": "assets/backgrounds/vol4_meld_lens_mandala.jpg"
    },
    {
      "t": "interlude",
      "text": "·",
      "sub": "Small Wood · 1994 · transmission · Pasadena",
      "duration": 1800
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "A heron. A minivan. A heron."
    },
    {
      "t": "bg",
      "src": "assets/backgrounds/vol1_city_color_night.jpg"
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "Neon in the shape of a crab. A crab in the shape of neon."
    },
    {
      "t": "bg",
      "src": "assets/backgrounds/vol3_hospital_room_night.jpg"
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "Ducks on a television. Autumn ducks. The same pond going around."
    },
    {
      "t": "bg",
      "src": "assets/backgrounds/vol4_xerox_sky.jpg"
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "weep. weep. FOR THE FUTURE, struck through."
    },
    {
      "t": "bg",
      "src": "assets/backgrounds/vol4_meld_lens_mandala.jpg"
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "The Writer",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "A moment ago I was debating whether or not to begin."
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "Aud",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "Everybody's here, hon."
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "The pieces slide and click. Every turn the same pieces. Every turn a different room."
    },
    {
      "t": "flag",
      "key": "meld_lens_opened",
      "val": true
    },
    {
      "t": "choice",
      "prompt": "turn the lens.",
      "opts": [
        {
          "text": "the water tower, in wet paint",
